<h1>Review path updated</h1>
<p>
  An administrator updated the review hierarchy for your request
  <strong>“<%= @request.title %>”</strong>.
</p>
<p>
  It is now awaiting <strong><%= @landing_role.name %></strong>
  <% if @reviewer %>
    (<%= @reviewer.name.presence || @reviewer.email %>)
  <% end %>.
  Previous approvals on roles that still appear in the new path were preserved where possible.
</p>
<%= render "details" %>
